  speakerName: "Ph\xF3 l\xE0ng"
  title: "Ra m\u1EAFt"
  content: "\"Ch\xE0o c\u1EADu, t\xF4i l\xE0 ph\xF3 l\xE0ng \u2014 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
    lo li\u1EC7u m\u1ECDi vi\u1EC7c l\u1EDBn nh\u1ECF trong l\xE0ng n\xE0y. Tr\u01B0\u1EDFng
    l\xE0ng \u0111\xE3 giao c\u1EADu cho t\xF4i d\u1EABn d\u1EAFt, t\u1EEB nay c\u1EE9
    g\u1ECDi t\xF4i khi c\u1EA7n b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC.\""
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
